  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Illuminated Cartography.</strong> You can cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFaerieFire]{Faerie Fire} without expending a spell slot, outlining the affected creatures as if in ink. You can do so a number of times equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><p><strong>Portal Jump.</strong> On your turn, you can spend movement equal to half your Speed (round down) to teleport to an unoccupied space you can see within 10 feet of you, or within 5 feet of a creature within 30 feet of you that holds one of your Adventurer's Atlas maps. You can't use this benefit if your Speed is 0.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-ViJAxzX4gQa1ytTa\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Spend a use, then cast Faerie Fire from your sheet without a slot.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
